# Build output belongs to the machine that produced it. Copied into the image it does not just waste
# a layer — restore and build read what is already in obj/, so a stale or foreign-platform artifact
# is used in preference to the one this build would have produced.
**/bin/
**/obj/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
tests/
docs/
claudedocs/

# README.md is deliberately not ignored: Directory.Build.props includes the repo-root readme as a
# packaging item for every project, and the build reads that item list whether or not it packs.
